{"overview":"چهار دوست طول عمر متوجه می‌شوند که در میان شغل‌ها، روابط، خانواده‌ها و مسئولیت‌های روزمره، فراموش کرده‌اند چگونه به خود و یکدیگر مراقبت کنند. خسته و نیازمند استراحت، زنان به یک مرکز اسپا لوکس فرار می‌کنند تا یک آخر هفته فراموش‌نشدنی را صرف سرگرمی، خنده و تصمیمات بسیار بد کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Four lifelong friends realize that somewhere between careers, relationships, families, and everyday responsibilities, they’ve forgotten how to take care of themselves and each other. Burned out and overdue for a break, the women escape to a luxury spa retreat for an unforgettable weekend dedicated to fun, laughter, and a lot of really bad decisions.","tagline_en":"Friendship is a real trip.","runtime":97,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Jon Lucas","Scott Moore"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"لزلی من","role":"Jane","photo":"/gUOCQBjjjGnWkxjMOc1LmrC0U1k.jpg","en":"Leslie Mann"},{"name":"Michelle Buteau","role":"Coco","photo":"/mgAH1JsATQXsQPwquuNJpqux4TO.jpg"},{"name":"آنا فاریس","role":"Sophie","photo":"/tptTb0BQwCpKWETNqzkZzzf5qSZ.jpg","en":"Anna Faris"},{"name":"ایسلا فیشر","role":"Mel","photo":"/vVeKcMyFMPcIDLYNAnGSGnQrJ3k.jpg","en":"Isla Fisher"},{"name":"Adam Demos","role":"Kai","photo":"/cfeDhsrviNLG30e7cZOABqoKIQc.jpg"},{"name":"Dominic Ona-Ariki","role":"Roger","photo":"/xGdtiWh06fVMAuVOUONcFVva2n9.jpg"},{"name":"Erika Heynatz","role":"Shanti","photo":"/gfzEzRE2ScFSSOaNrSwrjHSQVnV.jpg"},{"name":"Courtney Clarke","role":"Ayurveda","photo":"/zAerkipyeHkUwkR1mSL3iL35epr.jpg"},{"name":"Quinn Aune","role":"Young Mel","photo":"/hQcg9uijh53xs4YmNeE60K8JRML.jpg"},{"name":"Sierra Rose","role":"Young Coco","photo":"/fqFA0nrvDD7MRtSitZJSpGIzUXj.jpg"},{"name":"Juliet Sargent","role":"Young Sophie","photo":"/2LWnvKbd73byld91Pz43zb107E2.jpg"},{"name":"Everly Graves","role":"Young Jane","photo":"/igSTeCGuXGwrEnbdwedabg2KBZ2.jpg"}],"trailer":"AhsA9ZqRAXQ","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1341138